Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Versions: Halyard in Klipper's place, by name

printer.info's software_version is Halyard's own version, so Klipper's minimum version is not checked against it, the Host row shows it whole (not cut to Klipper's four parts), and the About tooltip names the app instead of showing Klipper's logo.

diff --git a/src/components/dialogs/AboutDialog.vue b/src/components/dialogs/AboutDialog.vue
index ff69e1a..da48471 100644
--- a/src/components/dialogs/AboutDialog.vue
+++ b/src/components/dialogs/AboutDialog.vue
@@ -12,8 +12,15 @@
                 <v-icon small class="moonraker-logo">{{ mdiMoonWaningCrescent }}</v-icon>
             </div>
             <div>{{ moonrakerVersion }}</div>
-            <div><img height="12" src="/img/klipper.svg" class="klipper-logo" alt="klipper-logo" /></div>
-            <div>{{ klipperVersion }}</div>
+            <template v-if="klipperAppName === 'Klipper'">
+                <div><img height="12" src="/img/klipper.svg" class="klipper-logo" alt="klipper-logo" /></div>
+                <div>{{ klipperVersion }}</div>
+            </template>
+            <!-- Halyard: another app in Klipper's place is named, not shown with Klipper's logo -->
+            <template v-else>
+                <div></div>
+                <div>{{ klipperAppName }} {{ klipperVersion }}</div>
+            </template>
         </v-container>
     </v-tooltip>
 </template>
